</section></score></mdiv></body>
<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>O Lord, Thou art the Spirit now</l><l>That with Thy power liberates;</l><l>And by Thy liberation true</l><l>The law of life now regulates.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>O Lord, Thou art the Spirit now</l><l>That transforms us and saturates,</l><l>And to Thine image true conforms</l><l>And with Thy light illuminates.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>O Lord, Thou art the Spirit now</l><l>Who in my spirit makes His home;</l><l>He mingles with my spirit too,</l><l>And both one spirit thus become.</l></lg>
<lg label="5."><l>Lord, teach me how to exercise</l><l>My spirit now to contact Thee,</l><l>That in Thy Spirit I may walk</l><l>And live by Thy reality.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
